# 8-Bit Music Box song
# An IMPRESSION of the "Ritirata" (retreat of the night watch) from Boccherini's
# La musica notturna delle strade di Madrid, Op. 30 No. 6 - written from memory,
# NOT a transcription: march character, oom-pah accompaniment and the slow
# crescendo of the approaching watch are Boccherini's idea; these notes are not his.
format 1
title "Musica notturna di Madrid - Ritirata (impression)"
